{"html":"<p>Pass a number where a component expects a string, forget a required prop, or misspell a variant, and plain React finds out at run time, if at all. With TypeScript, the editor underlines it as you type. Most React projects use TypeScript today, and you need only a handful of patterns.</p>\n<h2 id=\"typing-props\">Typing Props</h2>\n<p>Describe the props with a type, then use it in the parameter:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">type</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\"> ButtonProps</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">  label</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">:</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">  variant</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> \"primary\"</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> \"secondary\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">  onClick</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">:</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=></span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">function</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> Button</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">label</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">variant</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> \"primary\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">onClick</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">:</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\"> ButtonProps</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">button</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> className</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">={</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">variant</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">}</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> onClick</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">={</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">onClick</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">}</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">      {</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">label</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">button</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><ul>\n<li><code>?</code> makes a prop optional; give it a default when destructuring.</li>\n<li><code>&quot;primary&quot; | &quot;secondary&quot;</code> is a <strong>union</strong> of allowed values. The editor autocompletes them and rejects anything else.</li>\n<li><code>() =&gt; void</code> is a function that takes nothing and returns nothing.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Now these are errors before you even run the app:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">Button</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> label</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"Save\"</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> variant</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"danger\"</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> onClick</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">={</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">save</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">}</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> />   </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// \"danger\" isn't allowed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">Button</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> label</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"Save\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> />                                   </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// onClick is missing</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>Name the type <code>ComponentNameProps</code>, and prefer <code>type</code> for props: it&#39;s what most React code uses.</p>\n<h2 id=\"children\">children</h2>\n<p>Content between tags is typed as <code>ReactNode</code>, which covers elements, text, numbers, lists and <code>null</code>:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">import</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> { ReactNode } </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">from</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> \"react\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">function</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> Panel</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">title</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">children</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">:</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">title</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">:</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">; </span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">children</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">:</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\"> ReactNode</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">section</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">h2</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">{</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">title</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">}</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">h2</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">      {</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">children</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">section</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><h2 id=\"state\">State</h2>\n<p><code>useState</code> infers the type from the initial value: <code>useState(0)</code> is a number, <code>useState(&quot;&quot;)</code> a string. When the initial value doesn&#39;t show the full type, like <code>null</code> before data loads, give it explicitly:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">type</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\"> User</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">id</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">:</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">; </span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">name</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">:</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">const</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">selected</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">setSelected</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">] </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> useState</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">User</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>TypeScript then makes you check for <code>null</code> before using it: <code>selected?.name</code>, or <code>if (selected)</code>. That&#39;s exactly the bug it prevents.</p>\n<h2 id=\"events\">Events</h2>\n<p>Event handlers get typed event objects. Inline handlers are inferred, but separate functions need the type:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">import</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> { ChangeEvent, FormEvent } </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">from</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> \"react\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">function</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> handleChange</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">event</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">:</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\"> ChangeEvent</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">HTMLInputElement</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">  setQuery</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(event.target.value); </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// value is known to be a string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">function</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> handleSubmit</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">event</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">:</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\"> FormEvent</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">HTMLFormElement</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  event.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">preventDefault</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>The pattern is <code>XxxEvent&lt;HTMLElementType&gt;</code>: <code>MouseEvent&lt;HTMLButtonElement&gt;</code>, <code>KeyboardEvent&lt;HTMLInputElement&gt;</code>. Hover the <code>onChange</code> attribute in your editor and it shows the exact type to use.</p>\n<h2 id=\"extending-html-props\">Extending HTML Props</h2>\n<p>A wrapper around a native element should accept all of that element&#39;s attributes. <code>ComponentProps</code> gives you them:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">import</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> { ComponentProps } </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">from</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> \"react\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">type</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\"> IconButtonProps</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\"> ComponentProps</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"button\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">> </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">icon</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">:</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">function</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> IconButton</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">icon</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">children</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">...</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">rest</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">:</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\"> IconButtonProps</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">button</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> {...</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">rest</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">}</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">      {</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">icon</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">}</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">children</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">button</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">IconButton</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> icon</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"★\"</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> type</span><span style=\"