event handlers as <code>ChangeEvent&lt;HTMLInputElement&gt;</code>, <code>FormEvent&lt;HTMLFormElement&gt;</code> and so on.</li>\n<li>Extend native elements with <code>ComponentProps&lt;&quot;button&quot;&gt;</code>, and model states with discriminated unions.</li>\n</ol>\n"}